      "causes": ["hyp.federation"],
      "rationale": "A methodical elimination. Service health is checked first (ev05), the log lookup shows the attempts do reach Entra and fail as federated rejections with no policy or token results (ev06), the proxy and resolver tests are clean (ev08), cache, session and device checks add nothing (ev09, ev12), and the engineer's own note (ev13) lists what is set aside. The node report (ev17) then shows one federation server on an expired signing certificate, which matches the rows and the one-in-three pattern (ev18). Hearsay about Microsoft and the proxy (ev01) and the hedged first statements of the engineer in ev07 about untested nodes carry no signals. Workaround and permanent fix are kept apart (ev19, ev24) and checked (ev22).",
